<title>USA: Huntsman still interested in buying Rexene.</title>
<headline>Huntsman still interested in buying Rexene.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Huntsman Corp said on Monday it remains interested in acquiring Rexene Corp for $16 per share.</p>
<p>Huntsman originally made the unsoliticed offer in October and Rexene rejected it.</p>
<p>A group of Rexene investors is pressuring the company to consider Huntsman's offer. A special shareholders' meeting is set for April 30.</p>
<p>Rexene, based in Dallas, makes thermoplastics and petrochemicals. Its shares closed Monday at 13-5/8, unchanged on the day.</p>
</text>
